{"items":[{"id":"520649232","root":"520616835","user":{"id":"13986033","name":"桃花剑圣黎恩舒华泽","avatar":"45e2b376765794cf73347468"},"text":"别输了就利益就资本，那这届ti18个菠菜队，你怎么解释雪碧打ig胜者组大优ck出玲珑心魔晶整蛊？是不是想去败者组多吃几把？","time":1634638199735,"floor":1,"likes":1,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"520650837","root":"520616835","user":{"id":"46304689","name":"PPPaul","avatar":"a6d23e92bf1bc8cf67eccfec"},"text":"有没有可能LGD才是被保送的那个呢？秘密打LGD各种犯蠢，决赛雪碧输的两盘也瞎选瞎打，有没有可能是他们放了水呢？","time":1634639139808,"floor":1,"likes":1,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"520666016","root":"520616835","user":{"id":"123824","name":"蓝字","avatar":"98c51f1fc4d31ab229e2610d"},"text":"[color=#4f81bd]不在动态讨论这事了。我个人是觉得假赛嫌疑很大的，LGD决赛场125局和34局的表现都不像同一支队伍，老将做了第五局的战况分析，有几个很明显的疑点，可以搜一下。如果要讨论是否假赛可以去这个贴：[resource id=31453251 type=3 icon=https://ali-imgs.acfun.cn/udata/pkg/acfun/icon_comment_pc_article_18_3.png]TI10被质疑假赛，网友整理赌博公司对TI的渗透[/resource]\n另外，操控比赛一般是关键场次，不会是所有比赛场次，那样成本太高划不来[/color]","time":1634643203666,"floor":1,"likes":1,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"520667124","root":"520616835","user":{"id":"123824","name":"蓝字","avatar":"98c51f1fc4d31ab229e2610d"},"text":"[color=#4f81bd]说错了，是老手发的，这个：[resource id=31457886 type=2 icon=https://ali-imgs.acfun.cn/udata/pkg/acfun/icon_comment_pc_vid_18_3.png]录像分析TI10总决赛第五场LGD是否假赛[/resource]\n[/color]","time":1634643447648,"floor":1,"likes":1,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false}],"media":{"45e2b376765794cf73347468":{"src":"https://tx-free-imgs.acfun.cn/Fm_tRqBPu1SRXcQhnMHtovDjcta6?imageslim","fallbacks":["https://imgs.aixifan.com/Fm_tRqBPu1SRXcQhnMHtovDjcta6"]},"98c51f1fc4d31ab229e2610d":{"src":"https://tx-free-imgs2.acfun.cn/bs2/acfun-image/123824_dec5a7aa9b784d95b6